# Local secrets/config for `wrangler pages dev` (auto-loaded from this directory).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# Marketing /chat no longer uses the Pages OpenRouter digivault Function.
# Point the static site at digichat Node (digigraph stack) via build-time:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DIGICHAT_EMBED_ORIGIN=https://digichat.digithings.ai
# See infra/digichat-digithings/README.md.
#
# Local stack preview (make local-stack): the default origin is production
# digithings.ai, whose frame-ancestors refuse a 127.0.0.1 parent, so the
# landing chat stays blank. Build with the local digichat instead, and point the
# digiquant band at the local dashboard-api:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DIGICHAT_EMBED_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:3006   # digichat `next dev`
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DASHBOARD_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8887       # dashboard-api `wrangler dev`
# digichat must register both `digithings.ai` and `127.0.0.1` in
# DIGICHAT_EMBED_TENANTS (dev mode admits loopback parents only when registered).
#
# The retired POST /api/chat Function returns 410; these keys are unused for chat.
